{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47891","headline":"宴柳毅诗 三 · 洞庭龙君","name":"宴柳毅诗 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧云悠悠兮泾水东流，伤嗟美人兮雨泣花愁。\n尺书远达兮以解君忧，哀冤果雪兮还处其休。\n荷君和雅兮感甘羞，山家寂寞兮难久留，欲将辞去兮悲绸缪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"洞庭龙君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}